<!-- A world copy of RFC 2045 Content-Transfer-Encoding: the codes the world uses, and others of the same list. No machine-readable copy of the source could be kept (RFC 2045, 6.1 (the tokens as the RFC writes them)); the codes and names are as the standard publishes them. Made by tools/build_codelists.py from world/codelists/lists.json. -->
